- Long-bg quiet 18s / soft-restart@~20s after pause None without one
  enableProxy reconnect (R30 — thrash; Ready needs ~20s+)
- Boot Ready-on-direct then enableProxy; pre-params addProxy; bearer-recover
  None mid-boot (R31/R31b — Ready→Connecting / «ожидание»)
- Soft-nudge-only after hop-try debounce (need socket reopen last resort)
- Writing geo result into debug AppBar pref / skipping geo forever after VPN
- Force-ON FakeTLS in debug ignoring non-RU geo (breaks VPN auto-off)
- Restoring 75s never-progressed video Ready 0B (R19 gap — ~2m UX)
- Restoring 45s progress-idle under Ready+FakeTLS / lastchance on ≤64KB
  thumbs / wire `album:prefetch` under FakeTLS (R22 — slot wedge)
- Zeroing long-bg restartCount on short resume while still Connecting
