- Soft-nudge-only after reopen×2 mid-ladder short resume (R23)
- Long-bg 35s quiet×N / Connecting ping-probe on kick ladder (R24)
- Preferred-skip mid-ladder after hop-try (R24 regressed — stuck 8443)
- Changing mtg without dial/DC203 evidence
- MiddleProxy migration while on mtg direct

